      "content": "Spring Authorization Server is a framework providing implementations of OAuth 2.1 and OpenID Connect 1.0 specifications. It exposes standard protocol endpoints for token issuance, token introspection, JWKS publication, device authorization, and OpenID Connect session management.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Spring Security Team",
